      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i feel like i dont even exist in this world anymore. like everyone is just moving through this fake, shallow reality and i'm just watching it from the outside. it's like i'm a ghost. i've seen things that make all this \"normal\" life feel so empty and pointless. i just don't belong here.",
